SCOPE_PROMPT = " Each catalog item also has scope metadata: these are available topics, never results. A broad ID such as physical_examination does NOT mean that all physical measurements or body systems are available. Match the requested topic as well as modality. For example, a skin examination cannot answer height/weight or a neurological examination. A single set of vital signs cannot answer orthostatic/postural measurements unless orthostatic is in the scope. If only part of a compound request is documented, return its ID and list the unsupported part. Treat hair_scalp as covering scalp/hair examination and range_of_motion as joint movement examination. An unspecified source image does not prove a specific modality or a specific examination is available; select it only for a generic request to see the source image. Never claim that an unlisted measurement is normal. Return original request phrases for unavailable parts."
